  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Productive Saftey Net Programme phase 5</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PSNP 5 &#xa0;is an extensive social protection programme targeted at 7.9 M vulnerable and food insecure people in Ethiopia. Its overall goal is to see &#x201c;Extreme poverty is reduced in rural Ethiopia&#x201d; through&#xa0;enhancing resilience of&#xa0;rural households affected by recurring climatic shocks and severe food insecurity.&#xa0;The program targets extreme poor (for the core caseload) and most vulnerable (for the transitory caseload) people. The interventions include delivering monthly cash and in kind food assistances for the target groups during lean season.</narrative>
  </description>
